dooai-engine is licensed under the Apache License 2.0 (see LICENSE).

It runs ONNX Runtime by Microsoft, linked into the binary (MIT licence).

The models are not included; `scripts/download-models.sh` downloads them from Hugging Face:
- PP-OCRv6 text detection and recognition, PP-OCRv5 recognizers for other alphabets and the PP-LCNet orientation
  classifiers, by PaddlePaddle (Apache 2.0), in the ONNX files published by PaddlePaddle.
- multilingual-e5-small by Microsoft Research / intfloat (MIT), as ONNX weights converted by Xenova.
